		<h1>Email Accounts</h1>
		<p>
			<strong>Email Accounts are email addresses that DeskPRO checks for new tickets and replies</strong>
		</p>
		<p>
			When you configure a new email account, DeskPRO will read email messages in the account and process
			new emails as new tickets, and replies as ticket replies.
		</p>
